subject: Verify your Detag email

--- text ---
Hi,

Thanks for creating a Detag account. Please verify your email address by opening this link:

http://localhost:8080/auth/verify-email?token=tok-abc-123

The link expires in 24 hours. If you did not create this account, you can ignore this email — no account will be activated without verification.

— The Detag team

