          <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#ffffff;margin:24px 0;padding:32px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#222222;">
            <tr>
              <td>
                <p>Hi,</p>
                <p>Thanks for creating a Detag account. Please verify your email address by opening the link below:</p>
                <p>
                  <a href="http://localhost:8080/auth/verify-email?token=tok-abc-123" style="display:inline-block;background:#1a73e8;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:4px;">Verify my email</a>
                </p>
                <p>Or copy this link into your browser:<br><a href="http://localhost:8080/auth/verify-email?token=tok-abc-123">http://localhost:8080/auth/verify-email?token=tok-abc-123</a></p>
                <p>The link expires in 24 hours. If you did not create this account, you can ignore this email — no account will be activated without verification.</p>
